1
00:00:00,739 --> 00:00:02,199
(Kurt:)Okay, maybe you didn't hear me.

2
00:00:02,366 --> 00:00:04,406
(Kurt:)- Go away.
- All right, Kurt, be nice.

3
00:00:04,576 --> 00:00:07,166
Oh, I am being nice.

4
00:00:07,329 --> 00:00:09,119
Right, little buddy?

5
00:00:09,289 --> 00:00:11,419
(Leonard:)- Kurt.
- Okay.

6
00:00:11,834 --> 00:00:15,424
(Leonard:)I understand your impulse
to try to physically intimidate me.

7
00:00:15,587 --> 00:00:18,047
(Leonard:)You can't compete with me
on an intellectual level...

8
00:00:18,215 --> 00:00:21,005
(Leonard:)...and so you're driven
to animalistic puffery.

9
00:00:21,176 --> 00:00:23,426
(Kurt:)You calling me a puffy animal?

10
00:00:23,595 --> 00:00:24,725
Oh, of course not.

11
00:00:24,888 --> 00:00:27,228
(Penny:)No, he's not. You're not, right, Leonard?

12
00:00:27,891 --> 00:00:30,351
(Leonard:)No, I said animalistic.

13
00:00:30,519 --> 00:00:32,019
(Leonard:)Of course, we're all animals...

14
00:00:32,187 --> 00:00:35,567
(Leonard:)...but some of us have climbed
a little higher on the evolutionary tree.

15
00:00:35,732 --> 00:00:37,902
(Sheldon:)If he understands that, you're in trouble.

16
00:00:38,068 --> 00:00:39,948
So what? I'm unevolved?

17
00:00:40,112 --> 00:00:41,362
(Sheldon:)You're in trouble.

18
00:00:42,239 --> 00:00:45,619
(Kurt:)You know, you use a lot of big words
for such a little dwarf.

19
00:00:45,784 --> 00:00:46,824
(Penny:)Okay, Kurt, please.

20
00:00:46,994 --> 00:00:48,284
Look, Penny, it's okay.

21
00:00:48,453 --> 00:00:49,703
(Leonard:)I can handle this.

22
00:00:50,455 --> 00:00:53,625
I am not a dwarf, I'm a hobbit.

23
00:00:53,792 --> 00:00:54,832
(Leonard:)A hobbit.

24
00:00:55,002 --> 00:00:58,252
(Leonard:)Are misfiring neurons in your hippocampus
preventing the conversion...

25
00:00:58,422 --> 00:01:00,252
(Leonard:)...from short-term to long-term memory?

